# OS
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Design references. The Gmail and Drive screenshots are captures of a real
# account, so the folder's contents are excluded by default and anything safe to
# publish is re-added by name. `design/*` rather than `design/`, because git
# cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is itself excluded.
design/*
!design/README.md
!design/landing-page-mockup.html
# Brand assets (Step 6g). Generated geometry and type — no account data of any
# kind, and the whole point of them is to be used, so the folder is re-added
# whole rather than file by file.
!design/brand/

# Claude Code local artifacts
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Surveys and planning
surveys/